{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33226","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:39.185690+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Thanks for the report! `total_repeat_lengths` should be an `int` so this error shouldn't happen. I'll look.","created_at":"2025-11-10T22:35:23Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/33226#issuecomment-3514186785","id":3514186785,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33226","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc7Rdjwh","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3514186785/reactions"},"updated_at":"2025-11-10T22:35:23Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/3514186785","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/14262417?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/yashk2810","id":14262417,"login":"yashk2810","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MjYyNDE3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/yashk2810","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":null,"assignees":[],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\nThe auto_axes function correctly reshards all ordinary arguments:\nhttps://github.com/jax-ml/jax/blob/7e2184046e2a4de5538f7ba511b730533506cc27/jax/_src/pjit.py#L2941-L2946\n\nHowever, if an explicitly sharded array is provided as a kwarg no resharding is applied, and the resulting code will likely fail because the aval mesh is not the same as the context mesh (which has also been auto-axis'ed).\n\nConcretely this is an issue in the implementation of `jnp.repeat`:\nhttps://github.com/jax-ml/jax/blob/7e2184046e2a4de5538f7ba511b730533506cc27/jax/_src/numpy/lax_numpy.py#L6356-L6369\n\nWhere `repeats` is being specified as a kwarg.\n\nIt leads to the following code to fail:\n```python\nimport jax\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nfrom jax.sharding import Mesh, AxisType, PartitionSpec as P\n\nmesh = jax.make_mesh((len(jax.devices()),), ('data',), axis_types=(AxisType.Explicit,))\njax.set_mesh(mesh)\n\npositions = jnp.zeros((5, 3))\ncharges = jnp.ones((5,), dtype=jnp.int32)\nnum_electrons = 5\npositions = jnp.repeat(positions, charges, axis=0, total_repeat_length=num_electrons, out_sharding=P(None))\n```\nError:\n```\nValueError: For primitive slice, context mesh AbstractMesh('data': 1, axis_types=(Auto,), device_kind=cpu, num_tpu_cores=0) should match the aval mesh AbstractMesh('data': 1, axis_types=(Explicit,), device_kind=cpu, num_tpu_cores=0) for shape float32[5]. This error occurs at source:  <stdin>:1:12 (<module>)\n```\n\nTwo possible fixes:\n1. Reshard kwargs in `auto_axes`. The main reason stopping me from doing this, is that I think the current approach of resharding will fail for non-jax types without avals.\n2. Fix the broken kwargs approach in `jnp.repeat`, which will make my specific bug go away, but will leave up potential similar bugs, as well as leave open a footgun.\n\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n```\njax:    0.7.2\njaxlib: 0.7.2\nnumpy:  2.3.2\npython: 3.12.3 (main, Aug 14 2025, 17:47:21) [GCC 13.3.0]\ndevice info: NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090-2, 2 local devices\"\nprocess_count: 1\nplatform: uname_result(system='Linux', node='kworkstation', release='6.8.0-87-generic', version='#88-Ubuntu SMP PREEMPT_DYNAMIC Sat Oct 11 09:28:41 UTC 2025', machine='x86_64')\nXLA_PYTHON_CLIENT_MEM_FRACTION=.90\nXLA_FLAGS=--xla_gpu_enable_triton_gemm=true --xla_gpu_enable_latency_hiding_scheduler=true --xla_gpu_enable_highest_priority_async_stream=true --xla_gpu_all_reduce_combine_threshold_bytes=51200 --xla_gpu_per_fusion_autotune_cache_dir=xla_autotune_results --xla_gpu_strict_conv_algorithm_picker=false \n\n$ nvidia-smi\nMon Nov 10 22:08:49 2025       \n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| NVIDIA-SMI 580.95.05              Driver Version: 580.95.05      CUDA Version: 13.0     |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n| GPU  Name                 Persistence-M | Bus-Id          Disp.A | Volatile Uncorr. ECC |\n| Fan  Temp   Perf          Pwr:Usage/Cap |           Memory-Usage | GPU-Util  Compute M. |\n|                                         |                        |               MIG M. |\n|=========================================+========================+======================|\n|   0  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090        On  |   00000000:01:00.0 Off |                  N/A |\n|  0%   41C    P8              7W /  400W |   29458MiB /  32607MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |                  N/A |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n|   1  NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5090        On  |   00000000:03:00.0 Off |                  N/A |\n|  0%   36C    P8              3W /  400W |   29436MiB /  32607MiB |      0%      Default |\n|                                         |                        |                  N/A |\n+-----------------------------------------+------------------------+----------------------+\n\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n| Processes:                                                                              |\n|  GPU   GI   CI              PID   Type   Process name                        GPU Memory |\n|        ID   ID                                                               Usage      |\n|=========================================================================================|\n|    0   N/A  N/A            7325      C   ...s/qchem-simulation/bin/python      29448MiB |\n|    1   N/A  N/A            7325      C   ...s/qchem-simulation/bin/python      29426MiB |\n+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```","closed_at":"2025-11-11T00:15:10Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/44061?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/copybara-service","id":56741989,"login":"copybara-service[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NTY3NDE5ODk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/copybara-service%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/33226/comments","created